      "id": "2116248014180556838",
      "text": "eagle chokes at 100k images. pinterest is too noisy. mymind lives in the cloud. finder is too dumb. and every “AI search” sends my files to someone else’s server.\n\nall i wanted was to type “blue poster with big type” and find it in my own library. offline.\n\nso i built SOOTY.\n\nnative. local AI search. smooth at 100k images. one-time purchase.\n\n🤲 launching soon 👇",
